Source: linbox-repository
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Linbox OS Developers <os@linbox.in>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Homepage: https://github.com/tovganesh/linbox-os
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: linbox-repository
Architecture: all
Depends: linbox-keyring, ${misc:Depends}
Description: APT source for the Linbox OS repository
 Adds https://apt.linbox.in to APT as /etc/apt/sources.list.d/linbox.sources,
 restricted to the Linbox archive keys by Signed-By. Debian packages keep
 coming from Debian's own mirrors.
 .
 The channel is trixie-testing during development. To change it, edit the
 Suites line; dpkg keeps your edit on upgrades.
